Package: rmmc
Type: Package
Title: Multimarket Contact Measures
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Grigorij", "Ljubownikow", email = "g.ljubownikow@auckland.ac.nz", role = "cre"),
    person("Eric", "Yiu", email = "kyiu570@aucklanduni.ac.nz", role = "aut"))
Description: Calculates multimarket contact between firms. Seven measures are
    available: count, Evans & Kessides (1994), Feinberg (1985), Chen (1996),
    Baum & Korn (1996), Baum & Korn (1999), and Boeker, Goodstein, Stephan &
    Murmann (1997), each at the dyad, dyad-in-market, firm-in-market, market
    and market-firm levels. The measures follow the definitions in Gimeno and
    Jeong (2001) <doi:10.1016/S0742-3322(01)18013-7>. Firms are paired only
    within the markets they share, so large data sets are computed quickly.
